    <div class="section mitigation">
      <h2>Mitigation and Adaptation Pathways</h2>
      <div class="mitigation-text">
        <p>To limit warming to <strong>1.5°C</strong>, global GHG emissions must reach <strong>net zero CO₂ by ~2050</strong>. For 2°C, net zero by ~2070 is required.</p>
